00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:48.000
Kish alechavimcha, mahalimor mazod, v'amartalahem.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:51.000
So always, the Tora says.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:58.000
But, and there's one book, the book of Proverbs, which is dedicated to education.

